<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Tina 💗</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{
    margin:0; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#5b4050;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe8f1,#f8eaff,#e8f2ff);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .card{
    width:min(92%,430px); padding:32px 24px; text-align:center;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.72); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);
    border-radius:28px; box-shadow:0 15px 45px rgba(120,80,120,.18);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px); position:relative;
  }
  .heart{font-size:48px; animation:float 2.5s ease-in-out infinite}
  h1{margin:8px 0;color:#d86b9b;font-size:38px}
  h2{margin:4px 0 18px;font-size:22px}
  p{line-height:1.65;font-size:16px}
  .age{display:inline-block;margin:8px 0 16px;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff0f6;color:#cf5f91;font-weight:bold}
  button{
    border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;margin-top:10px;
    background:#d86b9b;color:white;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(216,107,155,.25)
  }
  #message{display:none;margin-top:18px;padding:16px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff7fb}
  .small{font-size:13px;opacity:.75;margin-top:20px}
  @keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}
  .spark{position:absolute;font-size:20px;opacity:.65}
  .s1{top:15px;left:22px}.s2{top:30px;right:25px}.s3{bottom:20px;left:25px}.s4{bottom:28px;right:25px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="spark s1">✦</div><div class="spark s2">♡</div>
    <div class="spark s3">✧</div><div class="spark s4">♡</div>
    <div class="heart">🎂</div>
    <h1>Happy Birthday!</h1>
    <h2>Selamat ulang tahun, Timoy 💗</h2>
    <div class="age">16 tahun • 9 Agustus 🎀</div>
    <p>
      Makin tua aja yaa 😭🎂<br>
      Gak kebayang besok udah bikin KTP kan hehe.
    </p>
    <p>
      Maaf ya aku cuma bisa kirim ini buat kamu soalnya aku bingung,
      lagi pusing banget hari ini banyak kerkom. Tapi kamu selalu ada kok diingatan aku.
      Walaupun aku udah gak bisa kesana, tapi aku janji kok aku bakal pulang lagi,
      tapi gak akan bisa cepet. Aku juga harus sekolah disini. Aku gak ngechat kamu
      karena aku tau kamu gak mau lagi dichat sama aku. Yaudahhh sampai sini aja ya. 💗
    </p>
    <button onclick="showMessage()">Pencet ini 🎁</button>
    <div id="message">
      <b>Pesan kecil 💌</b><br><br>
      Jangan pikir aneh-aneh terus 😭💗
    </div>
    <div class="small">— someone 💗</div>
  </main>
<script>
function showMessage(){
  const m=document.getElementById("message");
  m.style.display=m.style.display==="block"?"none":"block";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
